I think there’s a solid product idea underneath the colorful framing: build a system that continuously teaches people how to think with AI by publishing reusable patterns, examples, and experiments.

I would avoid optimizing for “projection of power” or creating misleading impressions. A stronger long-term strategy is to earn attention by producing genuinely useful work that people want to share.

Here’s a Pantheon artifact in that direction.

